  "_why_these_entries": {
    "added_2026-08-20": "The gate was RED on main with 7 violations, so it could never be used as the hard gate anya-code-fix-pr.yml treats it as. Each entry below was adjudicated individually; none was added to make a number go green.",
    "console_usage": "Backend error logging via console.error is this repo's established convention -- 87 peer files were ALREADY allowlisted. These 3 were simply missing from a list that covers their siblings. Converting them to a logger would be a different, much wider change.",
    "unhandled_then": "Both are FALSE POSITIVES of a heuristic that cannot see an await. searxngProvider.js:56 carries its own proof in a comment ('Chain never rejects (the body only sleeps), so no catch needed'), and llmTimeout.js:47 passes the promise straight into Promise.race([p, deadline]) which is awaited in a try/finally, so rejection IS handled."
  }
